r-color shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--border-color)] uppercase\">DESIGN TRENDS</span><span class=\"bg-neo-yellow text-black px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono font-black rounded-md border border-border-color shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--border-color)] uppercase\">POPULAR</span></div></div><div class=\"p-5 flex flex-col flex-1\"><div class=\"text-sm font-mono font-bold text-cayenne uppercase mb-1.5\">Aug 01, 2026</div><h2 class=\"font-bold font-black text-black md:text-xl mb-3 leading-snug\">Why Neo-Brutalism is Taking Over Modern Web &amp; UI Design</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-black leading-relaxed mb-5 flex-1\">Thick outlines, raw typography, high-contrast color, and zero apologies. Explore why top studios and indie devs are ditching minimal for brutal.</p><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-border-color/80 flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-mono font-bold text-black\"><span>By <!-- -->PIXLApe Team</span><span>⏱️ <!-- -->5 min read</span></div></div></article></a><a href=\"/blog/2\"><article class=\"asset-card p-4 flex flex-col h-full hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:-translate-x-0.5 hover:shadow-hard-sm cursor-pointer overflow-hidden\" style=\"animation-delay:0.1s\"><div class=\"w-full h-48 bg-soft-linen border rounded-lg border-border-color overflow-hidden relative\"><img src=\"/icon/stock/blog002.svg\" alt=\"10 Developer &amp; Designer Tools for Maximum Productivity\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105\"/><div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 flex gap-2\"><span class=\"bg-darkteal text-white px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono font-black rounded-md border border-border-color shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--border-color)] uppercase\">WORKFLOW</span><span class=\"bg-neo-yellow text-black px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono font-black rounded-md border border-border-color shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--border-color)] uppercase\">GUIDE</span></div></div><div class=\"p-5 flex flex-col flex-1\"><div class=\"text-sm font-mono font-bold text-cayenne uppercase mb-1.5\">Jul 28, 2026</div><h2 class=\"font-bold font-black text-black md:text-xl mb-3 leading-snug\">10 Developer &amp; Designer Tools for Maximum Productivity</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-black leading-relaxed mb-5 flex-1\">From CLI batch converters to system cleanup scripts — the essential free-and-pro utilities every creator needs in their workflow this year.</p><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-border-color/80 flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-mono font-bold text-black\"><span>By <!-- -->Alex Rivers</span><span>⏱️ <!-- -->7 min read</span></div></div></article></a><a href=\"/blog/3\"><article class=\"asset-card p-4 flex flex-col h-full hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:-translate-x-0.5 hover:shadow-hard-sm cursor-pointer overflow-hidden\" style=\"animation-delay:0.2s\"><div class=\"w-full h-48 bg-soft-linen border rounded-lg border-border-color overflow-hidden relative\"><img src=\"/icon/stock/blog003.svg\" alt=\"Open Source &amp; Creative Commons Licensing: A Plain-English Guide\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105\"/><div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 flex gap-2\"><span class=\"bg-darkteal text-white px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono font-black rounded-md border border-border-color shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--border-color)] uppercase\">LICENSING</span><span class=\"bg-neo-yellow text-black px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-mono font-black rounded-md border border-border-color shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--border-color)] uppercase\">ESSENTIAL</span></div></div><div class=\"p-5 flex flex-col flex-1\"><div class=\"text-sm font-mono font-bold text-cayenne uppercase mb-1.5\">Jul 15, 2026</div><h2 class=\"font-bold font-black text-black md:text-xl mb-3 leading-snug\">Open Source &amp; Creative Commons Licensing: A Plain-English Guide</h2><p class=\"font-body text-sm text-black leading-relaxed mb-5 flex-1\">MIT, CC0, Apache 2.0, OFL — what each license actually means when you downloa